.TH DDM 1 "2026" "DoDownloadManager" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ddm \- multi-connection download manager
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ddm
[\fIOPTION\fR...] [\fIURL\fR...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
DoDownloadManager (DDM) splits downloads into parallel connections, resumes them
after restarts and downloads videos with yt-dlp. If DDM is already running, the
command is forwarded to the running instance.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-b ", " \-\-background
Start in the background without opening a window.
.TP
.B \-\-video
Download the given links as videos with yt-dlp.
.TP
.B \-\-now
Add the given links to the queue without a confirmation dialog.
.TP
.BR \-n ", " \-\-new
Open the new download dialog.
.TP
.BR \-q ", " \-\-quit
Quit the running instance.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/ddm/settings.json
Settings.
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/ddm/downloads.db
Download history and segment state.
.SH SEE ALSO
https://github.com/ddogukann/DoDownloadManager
